IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ssjtwa-boundary`

-- Straits Settlements and Johore Territorial Waters (Agreement) Act 1928, s 1 and Schedule Articles I to IV -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_straits-settlements-and-johore-territorial-waters-agreement-act-1928.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a fishing boat north of the channel line in the Strait` MEANS Place WITH
    `in Johore Strait or at its entrances` IS TRUE
    `on the Johore mainland side of the boundary line` IS TRUE
    `among the waters ceded by the 1824 Treaty` IS TRUE
    `within three nautical miles of the Johore mainland from low water mark` IS TRUE

